    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "When Oklahoma joined the Union in 1907, Okmulgee had 2,322 residents and served as the county seat.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Okmulgee%2C_Oklahoma"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A railroad ran from Muskogee to Okmulgee between 1902 and 1903, operating until its abandonment in 1973.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
