      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Okmulgee%2C_Oklahoma"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "By 1918 Okmulgee boasted three foundry and machine shops, three glass factories, and a bottle factory, marking its rise as a manufacturing hub.",
